<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/4 (FIM 207.86).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/4 (FIM 207.86).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed unchanged at $45-1/4 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 207.86 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed down 2.50 markka at 208.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/8 at $32-1/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.78 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.10 markka at 74.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Wednesday after closing down $0-5/8 at $19-3/4 on in New York last Thursday.</p>
<p>Rauma closed up 0.50 markka at 91.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
